Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.99,0:00:56.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(阿富汗  库纳尔省)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.82,0:01:28.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这气氛像是在送我上军事法庭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel like you're driving me to a court-martial.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.51,0:01:30.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的  我做了什么啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is crazy. What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.63,0:01:32.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉像是你们会停下车  然后灭了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel like you're going to pull over and snuff me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.25,0:01:33.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么  你们不许说话吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, you're not allowed to talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.70,0:01:34.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿甘哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Forrest!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.82,0:01:36.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以说话的  先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can talk, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.00,0:01:38.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊  那是对我有意见咯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see. So it's personal?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.61,0:01:39.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  你让他们害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you intimidate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.84,0:01:41.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老天爷  你是个妹子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good God, you're a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.37,0:01:43.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真是没看出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I honestly... I couldn't have called that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.13,0:01:45.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是觉得该道歉  但要的就是这个效果吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I'd apologise, but isn't that what we're going for here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.68,0:01:48.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我要首先把你当成士兵  - 我是空军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I thought of you as a soldier first. - I'm an airman.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.46,0:01:50.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的骨骼结构可真不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have, actually, excellent bone structure, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.46,0:01:53.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在眼睛都没法从你身上移开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm kind of having a hard time not looking at you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.14,0:01:54.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样奇怪吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.60,0:01:56.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啦  笑笑嘛  没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, it's okay, laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.30,0:01:59.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 先生  我有个问题  - 问吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sir, I have a question to ask. - Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.11,0:02:00.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您真跟去年《马克西姆》男士杂志的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it true you went 12 for 12
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.84,0:02:02.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,12位封面女郎都搞过吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with last year's Maxim cover models?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.79,0:02:05.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这问题问得好  是  也不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is an excellent question. Yes and no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.07,0:02:06.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三月女郎跟我有日程冲突\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}March and I had a scheduling conflict,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.57,0:02:09.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但幸好  圣诞刊的封面是双胞胎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but fortunately, the Christmas cover was twins.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.51,0:02:10.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有问题吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.02,0:02:12.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这举手是在开玩笑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're kidding me with the hand up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.54,0:02:16.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我可以跟您合个影吗  - 非常可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is it cool if I take a picture with you? - Yes. It's very cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.88,0:02:20.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.43,0:02:23.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可别给发到你的"我的空间"主页上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to see this on your MySpace page.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.51,0:02:25.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托  别比黑帮手势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, no gang signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.41,0:02:26.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开玩笑的  举起来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, throw it up. I'm kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.87,0:02:28.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和平  我爱和平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, peace. I love peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.89,0:02:30.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是和平了我就没生意了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd be out of a job with peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.15,0:02:32.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点啊  快按键拍照\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Hurry up. Just click it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.57,0:02:34.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别改设置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't change any settings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.78,0:02:41.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事  - 左侧遇敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's going on? - Contact left!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.79,0:02:42.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.73,0:02:46.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吉米  守住斯塔克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jimmy, stay with Stark!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.08,0:02:48.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 趴下  - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stay down! - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.35,0:02:55.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.55,0:03:00.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 等等  给我把枪  - 待在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait, wait, wait! Give me a gun! - Stay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.51,0:03:28.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(斯塔克工业)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.23,0:04:20.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《钢铁侠》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.38,0:04:21.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼·斯塔克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony Stark.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.69,0:04:23.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(拉斯维加斯  36小时前)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.20,0:04:25.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,远见家  天才\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Visionary. Genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.24,0:04:28.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国爱国者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}American patriot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.47,0:04:29.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至还年少时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even from an early age,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.61,0:04:32.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,传奇武器开发者霍华德·斯塔克的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the son of legendary weapons developer Howard Stark
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.07,0:04:35.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就很快凭其杰出独特的头脑吸引了大众目光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}quickly stole the spotlight with his brilliant and unique mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.99,0:04:38.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四岁时  他搭建了第一块电路板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At age four, he built his first circuit board.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.27,0:04:41.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,六岁时  他搭建了第一台引擎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At age six, his first engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.46,0:04:42.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.12,0:04:46.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,17岁时  他便以最优成绩从麻省理工学院毕业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And at 17, he graduated summa cum laude from MIT.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.68,0:04:46.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.98,0:04:49.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之后  一位巨头逝世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then, the passing of a titan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.55,0:04:51.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.02,0:04:53.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,霍华德·斯塔克终身的朋友和盟友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Howard Stark's lifelong friend and ally,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.07,0:04:54.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奥巴代亚·斯坦尼接手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obadiah Stane, steps in
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.68,0:04:57.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,填补了传奇创始人留下的空缺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to help fill the gap left by the legendary founder,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.65,0:05:01.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到21岁的浪子回归\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until, at age 21, the prodigal son returns
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.69,0:05:03.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.09,0:05:04.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成为了斯塔克工业的新执行总裁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and is anointed the new CEO of Stark lndustries.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.57,0:05:05.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掌握了王国的钥匙后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With the keys to the kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.88,0:05:08.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼将父亲的遗产带入了新的时代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony ushers in a new era for his father's legacy,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.87,0:05:10.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,制造了更智能的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}creating smarter weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.42,0:05:13.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先进机器人  卫星瞄准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}advanced robotics, satellite targeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.62,0:05:19.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.05,0:05:14.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如今  托尼·斯塔克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today, Tony Stark
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.31,0:05:16.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已改变了武器行业的面目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has changed the face of the weapons industry
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.94,0:05:19.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他确保了自由  并在全球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by ensuring freedom and protecting America
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.83,0:05:22.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保护美国和其利益\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and her interests around the globe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.70,0:05:33.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为与斯塔克工业的联络人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As liaison to Stark Industries,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.71,0:05:37.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我格外荣幸地能与一位真正的爱国者共事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've had the unique privilege of serving with a real patriot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.53,0:05:41.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我的朋友  也是我的好导师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is my friend and he is my great mentor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.74,0:05:44.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女士们先生们  我很荣幸能将今年的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen, it is my honour to present
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.50,0:05:48.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,极点奖授予托尼·斯塔克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this year's Apogee Award to Mr Tony Stark.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.53,0:05:56.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.09,0:06:11.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢  中校  - 谢谢救场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you, Colonel. - Thanks for the save.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.86,0:06:15.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这太美了  谢谢  非常感谢大家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is beautiful. Thank you. Thank you all very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.51,0:06:16.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.87,0:06:20.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是托尼·斯塔克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, l'm not Tony Stark.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.69,0:06:25.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果我是托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if I were Tony,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.35,0:06:28.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会告诉你们我感到多么荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would tell you how honoured I feel
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.28,0:06:31.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及接受如此高的荣誉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and what a joy it is to receive this very
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.55,0:06:33.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是多么令人开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}prestigious award.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.42,0:06:34.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼  要知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.05,0:06:38.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼最棒的地方  也是他最糟的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The best thing about Tony is also the worst thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.88,0:06:40.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他总在工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's always working.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.42,0:06:43.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Work it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.12,0:06:46.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这多棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.50,0:06:52.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们该一直待到早上  - 你真是难以置信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We should just stay till the morning. - You are unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.78,0:06:55.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕  是他们叫你来的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no! Did they rope you into this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.35,0:06:56.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没谁叫我做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody roped me into anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.53,0:06:57.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对不起  - 但他们跟我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm so sorry. - But they told me that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.72,0:07:00.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果由我来给你颁奖  你会倍感荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I presented you with an award, you'd be deeply honoured.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.30,0:07:02.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是当然  是你颁奖  多棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course I'd be deeply honoured. And it's you, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.32,0:07:04.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们什么时候颁  - 在这儿呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So when do we do it? - It's right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.08,0:07:05.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 再来一轮  - 给\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- One more round. - Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.02,0:07:06.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这儿啊  好轻松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There it is. That was easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.55,0:07:07.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真对不起  - 没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm so sorry. - Yeah, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.95,0:07:10.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看啊  这多特别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you look at that? That's something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.53,0:07:11.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这玩意我还没拿过呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have any of those floating around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.96,0:07:13.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们试试运气吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna let it ride!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.15,0:07:17.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我点运气吧  祝福一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a hand, will you? Give me a little something-something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.21,0:07:18.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  你也来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.46,0:07:20.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不吹别人的骰子  - 来嘛  蜜熊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't blow on a man's dice. - Come on, honey bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.51,0:07:23.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好嘞  罗德中校扔骰子咯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There it is. Lieutenant Colonel Rhodes rolls! And...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.15,0:07:24.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两点  好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two craps. Line away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.55,0:07:26.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 就这样了  - 这还不算最糟的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's what happens. - Worse things have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.23,0:07:28.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会有事的  请帮我把筹码整理好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we're gonna be fine. Colour me up, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.40,0:07:29.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我要走了  - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is where I exit. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.20,0:07:30.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天  别迟到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow, don't be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.21,0:07:31.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗯  没问题  - 我说真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, you can count on it. - I'm serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.71,0:07:32.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.17,0:07:36.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯撒的东西给凯撒吧  给\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Render unto Caesar that which is Caesar's. There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.11,0:07:43.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯塔克先生  等等  斯塔克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Stark! Excuse me, Mr Stark!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.72,0:07:45.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克莉丝汀·艾凡哈特  《名利场》杂志的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Christine Everhart, Vanity Fair magazine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.92,0:07:47.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以问您几个问题吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I ask you a couple of questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.17,0:07:48.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她很美  - 是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She's cute. - She's all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.69,0:07:51.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 当然  问吧  - 行吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. Okay, go. - It's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.00,0:07:53.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您被称为当代达·芬奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been called the da Vinci of our time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.96,0:07:54.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您对此有何看法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you say to that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.86,0:07:56.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,荒唐  我又不会画画\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely ridiculous. I don't paint.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.80,0:07:58.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那您怎么看待你的其他外号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what do you say to your other nickname?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.52,0:07:59.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"死亡商人"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The Merchant of Death"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.78,0:08:00.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不算坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.78,0:08:04.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜猜  伯克利毕业的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me guess. Berkeley?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.18,0:08:05.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实是布朗大学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brown, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.43,0:08:07.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布朗大学小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Ms Brown,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.28,0:08:10.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个不完美的世界  但我们只有这个世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's an imperfect world, but it's the only one we've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.41,0:08:11.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我向你保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guarantee you,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.14,0:08:13.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果哪天再不需要武器来维护和平了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the day weapons are no longer needed to keep the peace,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.13,0:08:15.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会开始为婴儿医院制造建材的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll start making bricks and beams for baby hospitals.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.57,0:08:16.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这段话常练吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rehearse that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.65,0:08:18.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每晚睡觉前都会对着镜子说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every night in front of the mirror before bedtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.40,0:08:20.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 看出来了  - 我想让你亲眼见识一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can see that. - I'd like to show you first-hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.80,0:08:23.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只想要个严肃的答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I want is a serious answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.19,0:08:25.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  说严肃的  我老爸有个理论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, here's serious. My old man had a philosophy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.39,0:08:27.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"和平就是比对方的棍子大"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Peace means having a bigger stick than the other guy."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.99,0:08:30.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卖棍子的人说这话真讨巧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a great line coming from the guy selling the sticks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.36,0:08:31.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我父亲帮忙打败了纳粹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father helped defeat the Nazis.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.65,0:08:33.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还参与了曼哈顿计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He worked on the Manhattan Project.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.08,0:08:35.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很多人  包括你布朗大学的教授们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lot of people, including your professors at Brown,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.87,0:08:37.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都会认为这叫英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would call that being a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.21,0:08:39.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也会有很多人称之为战争牟利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a lot of people would also call that war profiteering.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.42,0:08:41.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我  你打算报道我们靠推动医疗科技\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me, do you plan to report on the millions we've saved
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.47,0:08:43.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和改善农业技术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by advancing medical technology
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.08,0:08:45.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而让千百万人延续寿命  免受饥荒的事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or kept from starvation with our intelli-crops?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.99,0:08:47.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有那些突破\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All those breakthroughs,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.89,0:08:49.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是由军工提供的资金  亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}military funding, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.79,0:08:52.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这辈子失眠过吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever lose an hour of sleep your whole life?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.80,0:08:54.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我愿意跟你失眠几小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd be prepared to lose a few with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.81,0:09:10.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好  现在是早7点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning. It's 7:00 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.48,0:09:14.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马里布气温为22度  少云\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The weather in Malibu is 72 degrees with scattered clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.56,0:09:17.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冲浪条件不错  海浪到腰和肩之间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The surf conditions are fair with waist-to-shoulder high lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.85,0:09:20.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高潮时间为上午10:52\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}High tide will be at 10:52 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.42,0:09:36.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(加州  马里布)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.47,0:09:38.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.00,0:09:41.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Tony?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.02,0:10:05.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你无权进入这个区域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are not authorised to access this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.56,0:10:08.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 天呐  - 那是贾维斯  他是房子的管家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jesus. - That's Jarvis. He runs the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.78,0:10:11.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你的衣服  干洗熨烫过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got your clothes here. They've been dry-cleaned and pressed,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.47,0:10:13.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外面有辆车在等着你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and there's a car waiting for you outside
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.27,0:10:15.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会带你去任何你指定的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that will take you anywhere you'd like to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.97,0:10:19.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你一定是著名的派珀·波茨  - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You must be the famous Pepper Potts. - Indeed I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.03,0:10:22.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都这么多年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After all these years,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.15,0:10:24.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼还让你替他拿干洗衣物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony still has you picking up the dry-cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.96,0:10:28.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做任何斯塔克先生要我做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do anything and everything that Mr Stark requires,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.51,0:10:31.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偶尔也包括倒垃圾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}including, occasionally, taking out the trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.38,0:10:32.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有别的事了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will that be all?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.43,0:10:50.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扩展视图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me an exploded view.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.20,0:10:54.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,3号气缸的气压似乎过低了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The compression in cylinder three appears to be low.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.95,0:10:55.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记录一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Log that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.02,0:11:02.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我这就再试一次  - 请别把我的音乐关小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm gonna try again, right now. - Please don't turn down my music.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.05,0:11:03.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再通知你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll keep you posted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.04,0:11:04.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在应该在去往地球另一边的路上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are supposed to be halfway around the world right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.93,0:11:07.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她接受得如何  - 非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How'd she take it? - Like a champ.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.41,0:11:08.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么急着赶我走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you trying to hustle me out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.77,0:11:10.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的航班应该是一个半小时前离开的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your flight was scheduled to leave an hour and a half ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.70,0:11:13.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有意思  我以为考虑到那是我的飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's funny, I thought with it being my plane and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.13,0:11:14.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它会等我到了再出发呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that it would just wait for me to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.53,0:11:16.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼  我有几件事要跟你商量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony, I need to speak to you about a couple things
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.18,0:11:17.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我就要送你出门了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before I get you out of the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.13,0:11:18.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你还没到  飞机就飞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't it kind of defeat the whole purpose
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.68,0:11:19.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那有自己的飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of having your own plane
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.67,0:11:21.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不就没意义了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if it departs before you arrive?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.17,0:11:22.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拉里来电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Larry called.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.42,0:11:24.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他为杰克逊·波洛克画找到了新买家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got another buyer for the Jackson Pollock in the wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.50,0:11:26.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还想不想要它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want it? Yes or no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.36,0:11:28.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是他的"春"期代表作吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it a good representation of his spring period?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.22,0:11:31.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是  斯普林斯是他曾生活工作过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. The Springs was actually the neighbourhood in East Hampton
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.70,0:11:33.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个东汉普顿社区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where he lived and worked,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.06,0:11:34.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 并不是春天的"春"  - 是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- not "spring" like the season. - So?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.71,0:11:39.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得还可以  而且定价过高了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's a fair example. I think it's incredibly overpriced.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.95,0:11:42.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要  买  存起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need it. Buy it. Store it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.24,0:11:45.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  麻省理工学院毕业典礼讲话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. The MIT commencement speech...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.00,0:11:47.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,6月的事  拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is in June. Please,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.16,0:11:48.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别拿还没影的事来唠叨我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}don't harangue me about stuff that's way, way, down...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.35,0:11:51.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在唠叨我  我就答应了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're haranguing me, so I'm gonna say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.35,0:11:52.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反弹或吸收\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deflect it and absorb it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.12,0:11:53.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别传递给我  - 你上机前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't transmit it back to me. - I need you to sign this
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.67,0:11:55.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我需要你给这个签字  - 你干吗非要赶我走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- before you get on the plane. - What are you trying to get rid of me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.03,0:11:56.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有安排吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, you got plans?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.36,0:11:59.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 事实上  真有  - 我不喜欢你有安排\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- As a matter of fact, I do. - I don't like it when you have plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.05,0:12:01.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我生日这天是可以有安排的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm allowed to have plans on my birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.08,0:12:02.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 今天是你生日吗  - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's your birthday? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.79,0:12:04.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道的  这就到了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew that. Already?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.24,0:12:07.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  多奇怪啊  跟去年是同一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Isn't that strange? It's the same day as last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.71,0:12:11.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 拿我的钱给自己买点好东西吧  - 买了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get yourself something nice from me. - I already did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.48,0:12:13.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么样  - 可好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And? - It was very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.99,0:12:17.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗯  - 很有品味  谢谢  斯塔克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - Very tasteful. Thank you, Mr Stark.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.94,0:12:19.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不客气  波茨小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're welcome, Miss Potts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.33,0:12:24.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.71,0:12:46.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你挺厉害  我刚刚以为甩掉你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're good. I thought I lost you back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.93,0:12:48.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样  先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.38,0:12:51.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不得不抄穆赫兰道的捷径\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to cut across Mulholland.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.25,0:12:52.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被我甩掉了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you. I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.59,0:12:54.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什么毛病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.16,0:12:55.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么了  - 三小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Three hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.79,0:12:57.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忙着接受《名利场》的采访呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got caught doing a piece for Vanity Fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.83,0:13:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三小时  你让我在这儿站了三小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For three hours. For three hours you got me standing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.01,0:13:02.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在等你了  走吧  快来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Waiting on you now. Let's go. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.17,0:13:05.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起飞  开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wheels up! Rock and roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.27,0:13:15.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你看什么呢  鸭嘴兽  - 没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What you reading, platypus? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.89,0:13:18.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得了  酸糖娃  别生气嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, sour patch. Don't be mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.20,0:13:21.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说了  我没生气  我不在乎  好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you, I'm not mad. I'm indifferent, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.10,0:13:22.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我都道歉了  - 早上好  斯塔克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I said I was sorry. - Good morning, Mr Stark.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.56,0:13:23.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不用向我道歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't need to apologise to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.56,0:13:24.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我是你的哥们  - 我都跟他道歉了  但他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm your man. - I told him I was sorry, but he...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.89,0:13:26.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我现在就是不在乎了  - 热毛巾要吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm just indifferent right now. - Hot towel?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.70,0:13:29.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不尊重自己  所以我知道你不尊重我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't respect yourself, so I know you don't respect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.10,0:13:30.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我尊重你  - 我就是你的保姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I respect you. - I'm just your babysitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.21,0:13:33.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你需要换尿布了  谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, when you need your diaper changed... Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.18,0:13:35.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就告诉我  我去给你拿奶瓶  好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me know and I'll get you a bottle, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.04,0:13:37.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加热下清酒  好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heat up the sake, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.15,0:13:38.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 多谢提醒我  - 我不是说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks for reminding me. - No, I'm not talking...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.64,0:13:40.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不喝酒  我们在工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not drinking. We're working right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.51,0:13:42.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 吃生鱼片一定要配清酒  - 你根本就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You can't have sashimi without sake. - You are constitutionally
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.84,0:13:44.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做不到负责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}incapable of being responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.82,0:13:46.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不喝酒才不负责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would be irresponsible not to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.13,0:13:47.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过是一杯睡前酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just talking about a nightcap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.16,0:13:48.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,热清酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hot sake?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.39,0:13:49.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  来两杯  谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, two, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.24,0:13:51.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我不喝  我不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I'm not drinking. I don't want any.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.82,0:13:53.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就这意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.19,0:13:56.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早上起床  穿上军服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I get up in the morning and I'm putting on my uniform,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.19,0:13:58.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道我认得什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you know what I recognise?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.30,0:13:59.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在镜子里能看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see in that mirror that
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.54,0:14:03.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每一个穿着这军服的人都会照应我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}every person that's got this uniform on got my back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.46,0:14:05.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道吗  我跟你不一样  我不适合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you know what? I'm not like you. I'm not cut out...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.83,0:14:07.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  你不非得像我一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. You don't have to be like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.91,0:14:09.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你远不止现在的你自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're more than what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.32,0:14:11.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  我现在有点无法集中精神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you excuse me if I'm a bit distracted here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.39,0:14:14.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  你现在不能不集中精神  听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! You can't be distracted right now! Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.37,0:14:21.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(阿富汗  巴格兰空军基地)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.13,0:14:32.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.15,0:14:33.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎  斯塔克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome, Mr Stark.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.19,0:14:35.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们很期待您的武器展示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We look forward to your weapons presentation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.99,0:14:36.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.73,0:14:41.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被恐惧和被尊敬  哪个更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it better to be feared or respected?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.82,0:14:45.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我说  两个都要算过分吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say, is it too much to ask for both?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.83,0:14:48.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因此  我谦卑地献上斯塔克工业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With that in mind, I humbly present the crown jewel
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.76,0:14:50.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自由系列的旗舰产品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of Stark Industries' Freedom Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.67,0:14:51.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是第一个融入了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the first missile system
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.71,0:14:54.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的专利冲击科技的导弹系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to incorporate our proprietary repulsor technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.82,0:14:58.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人说最好的武器是不需要使用的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say the best weapon is one you never have to fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.90,0:15:00.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我尊重地表示不同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I respectfully disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.93,0:15:05.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我更喜欢你只需要使用一次的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I prefer the weapon you only have to fire once.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.23,0:15:08.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我老爸就这么做  美国就这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how Dad did it. That's how America does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.13,0:15:11.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且到目前一直挺成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's worked out pretty well so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.48,0:15:12.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找个借口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find an excuse
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.83,0:15:16.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发射一次这玩意  我亲自担保\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to let one of these off the chain, and I personally guarantee you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.26,0:15:19.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坏蛋再也不会想从洞里爬出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the bad guys won't even want to come out of their caves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.22,0:15:42.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,供您参考  耶利哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For your consideration, the Jericho.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.36,0:15:54.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每笔超过五亿的交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be throwing one of these in
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.30,0:15:56.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我送一个这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with every purchase of 500 million or more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.85,0:15:57.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敬和平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.56,0:16:01.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 托尼  - 奥比  你怎么起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tony. - Obie, what are you doing up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.80,0:16:04.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不清楚情况我睡不着  展示得怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't sleep till I found out how it went. How'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.24,0:16:06.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好  看来圣诞节要提前了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It went great. Looks like it's gonna be an early Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.05,0:16:10.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好样的  伙计  明天见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Way to go, my boy! I'll see you tomorrow, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.23,0:16:11.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么没穿我送你的睡衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why aren't you wearing those pyjamas I got you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.45,0:16:13.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安  托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night, Tony.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.68,0:16:17.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 托尼  - 抱歉  这辆车是"欢乐马"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Tony. - I'm sorry, this is the "Fun-vee."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.16,0:16:19.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"悍无聊马"在后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The "Hum-drum-vee" Is back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.51,0:16:21.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好样的  - 基地见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nice job. - See you back at base.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.92,0:17:30.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我劝你别那么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't do that if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.79,0:18:09.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对我做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell did you do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.42,0:18:11.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.14,0:18:15.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做的事是救你命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I did is to save your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.26,0:18:18.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经尽力移除了很多弹片  但还剩不少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I removed all the shrapnel I could, but there's a lot left,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.76,0:18:21.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且它们都在往你的房隔去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it's headed into your atrial septum.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.38,0:18:22.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想看看吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, want to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.89,0:18:26.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我留了纪念品  看看吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a souvenir. Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.40,0:18:31.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在我的村子里见过不少这样的伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen many wounds like that in my village.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.81,0:18:34.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们称他们为将死行尸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We call them the walking dead
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.33,0:18:35.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为大概要一周\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because it takes about a week
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.50,0:18:37.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弹片才会进入重要器官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the barbs to reach the vital organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.45,0:18:41.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是什么  - 那是块电磁铁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is this? - That is an electromagnet,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.12,0:18:43.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连在了汽车电池上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hooked up to a car battery,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.28,0:18:45.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它在阻止弹片进入你的心脏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it's keeping the shrapnel from entering your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.41,0:18:56.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错  笑笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right. Smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.20,0:19:02.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们见过一次  在伯尔尼的一场科技大会上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We met once, you know, at a technical conference in Bern.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.75,0:19:05.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不记得了  - 当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't remember. - No, you wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.84,0:19:08.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我喝得那么醉  肯定站都站不直\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I had been that drunk, I wouldn't have been able to stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.90,0:19:12.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更别说就集成电路发表讲话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}much less give a lecture on integrated circuits.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.35,0:19:13.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.43,0:19:17.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快起来  起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, stand up. Stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.13,0:19:20.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,学我的样子做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just do as I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.05,0:19:22.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把手举起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, put your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.95,0:19:26.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我的枪  他们怎么弄到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those are my guns. How did they get my guns?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.45,0:19:28.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听懂了没  学我的样子做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you understand me? Do as I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.31,0:19:53.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说："欢迎  托尼·斯塔克  美国历史上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He says, "Welcome, Tony Stark, the most famous mass murderer
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.65,0:19:55.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最著名的大屠杀犯"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the history of America."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.79,0:19:59.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他很荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is honoured.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.83,0:20:04.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要你给他建导弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants you to build the missile.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.02,0:20:08.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你展示的那个耶利哥导弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Jericho missile that you demonstrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.00,0:20:12.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.19,0:20:19.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我拒绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.00,0:20:30.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.08,0:21:15.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(斯塔克工业)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.85,0:21:23.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他问你觉得怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants to know what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.22,0:21:26.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你有好多我的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you got a lot of my weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.03,0:21:36.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说他们有你需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He says they have everything
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.78,0:21:39.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿来建造耶利哥的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you need to build the Jericho missile.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.80,0:21:42.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要你列出材料清单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants you to make the list of materials.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.49,0:21:47.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说要你立刻开始动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He says for you to start working immediately,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.96,0:21:51.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做好了  他就放了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and when you're done, he will set you free.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.53,0:21:57.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不  他不会的  - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, he won't. - No, he won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.81,0:22:12.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们肯定在找你  斯塔克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure they're looking for you, Stark.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.44,0:22:16.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但在这些山里  他们是找不到你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they will never find you in these mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.82,0:22:22.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你刚刚看到一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, what you just saw,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.76,0:22:24.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是你的遗产  斯塔克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that is your legacy, Stark.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.42,0:22:29.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一生的心血  落在那些杀人犯手里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your life's work, in the hands of those murderers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.93,0:22:31.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想这样死去吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that how you want to go out?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.70,0:22:35.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是伟大的托尼·斯塔克的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this the last act of defiance
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.50,0:22:37.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后反抗吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the great Tony Stark?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.38,0:22:40.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是说你要想想办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or are you going to do something about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.09,0:22:41.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我何必还要做点什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why should I do anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.23,0:22:45.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们无论如何都会杀了你  杀了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're going to kill me, you, either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.24,0:22:47.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算不  我大概也活不过一周\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if they don't, I'll probably be dead in a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.54,0:22:49.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.55,0:22:53.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一周就对你至关重要了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this is a very important week for you, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.39,0:22:57.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果这里要做我的工作站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If this is going to be my work station,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.63,0:22:59.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要灯火通明  这个竖好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want it well-lit. I want these up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.00,0:23:02.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要焊接工具  乙炔和丙烷的都行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need welding gear. I don't care if it's acetylene or propane.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.96,0:23:03.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要焊接工作台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a soldering station.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.96,0:23:05.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,头盔  护目镜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need helmets. I'm gonna need goggles.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.37,0:23:09.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还要熔炼杯  两组精密工具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would like a smelting cup. I need two sets of precision tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.16,0:23:16.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(斯塔克工业)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.03,0:23:24.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你说多少种语言  - 好多种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How many languages do you speak? - A lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.55,0:23:26.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但看来在这里还是不够用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But apparently, not enough for this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.31,0:23:29.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们说阿拉伯语  乌尔都语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They speak Arabic, Urdu,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.52,0:23:31.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达里语  帕施图语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}dari, Pashto,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.23,0:23:33.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蒙古语  波斯语  俄语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mongolian, Farsi, Russian.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.02,0:23:35.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是什么人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.41,0:23:38.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是你的忠实顾客  先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are your loyal customers, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.94,0:23:41.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们自称"十戒组织"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They call themselves the Ten Rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.41,0:23:51.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你告诉我你的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, we might be more productive
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.90,0:23:54.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的动作可能会更快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you include me in the planning process.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.22,0:24:05.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  我们不需要这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we don't need this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.52,0:24:08.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.49,0:24:13.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钯  0.15克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's palladium, 0.15 grammes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.45,0:24:14.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要至少1.6\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need at least 1.6,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.72,0:24:16.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去把另外11个拆了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so why don't you go break down the other 11?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.10,0:24:21.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.02,0:24:23.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干活儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Working.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.56,0:24:36.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心  我们只有一次机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful. Careful, we only get one shot at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.55,0:24:39.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心  我手很稳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relax. I have steady hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.15,0:24:41.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不你怎么会还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you think you're still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.96,0:24:52.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么称呼你  - 我叫殷森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do I call you? - My name is Yinsen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.91,0:24:55.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,殷森  认识你很高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yinsen. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.16,0:24:57.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也很高兴认识你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice to meet you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.04,0:25:40.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那看上去不像耶利哥导弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That doesn't look like a Jericho missile.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.71,0:25:43.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为那是个迷你方舟反应堆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's because it's a miniaturised arc reactor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.19,0:25:46.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我家里有个大的给我的工厂供电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a big one powering my factory at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.39,0:25:49.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这应该足以阻止弹片进入我的心脏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It should keep the shrapnel out of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.12,0:25:51.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但它能产生什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what could it generate?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.88,0:25:54.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我没算错  我通常不会算错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If my math is right, and it always is,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.94,0:25:56.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每秒能产生3千兆焦耳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}three gigajoules per second.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.98,0:25:59.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那足以让你的心跳50辈子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That could run your heart for 50 lifetimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.79,0:26:02.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者让什么大玩意跑15分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or something big for 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.70,0:26:14.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是我们逃离的方法  - 是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is our ticket out of here. - What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.40,0:26:18.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摊平了看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flatten them out and look.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.67,0:26:26.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.37,0:26:53.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.34,0:26:57.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good roll. Good roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.85,0:26:59.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还没跟我说你是哪里人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You still haven't told me where you're from.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.78,0:27:02.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来自一个叫科米拉的小镇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm from a small town called Gulmira.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.04,0:27:06.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那里其实很不错  - 有家人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's actually a nice place. - Got a family?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.44,0:27:10.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有  等我离开这里  就能见到他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, and I will see them when I leave here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.64,0:27:12.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你呢  斯塔克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you, Stark?
