Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.06,0:29:19.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,曾是武器科技的巅峰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}once was the pinnacle of weapons technology.
