Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.24,0:31:07.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要什么  完成日期吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want? A delivery date?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.85,0:31:16.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need him.
