Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.49,0:33:20.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不会  - 那就说匈牙利语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't... - Then speak Hungarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.74,0:33:23.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好吧  我会...  - 你会什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay. I know. - What do you know?
