Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.10,0:33:50.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 倒是挺成功  - 我就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It worked all right. - That's what I do.
