Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.89,0:33:54.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.89,0:33:57.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快  - 你说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now! - Tell me. Tell me.
