Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.85,0:42:48.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是喜悦的眼泪  我讨厌找工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tears of joy. I hate job hunting.
