Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.65,0:42:58.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 得让医生给你看看  - 我不非得做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The doctor has to look at you. - I don't have to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.65,0:43:00.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我被囚三个月了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been in captivity for three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.68,0:43:01.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有两件想做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are two things I want to do.
