Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.59,0:43:05.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 还有一件...  - 够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- and the other... - That's enough of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.90,0:43:06.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是你想的那件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is not what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.57,0:43:08.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你马上召开记者招待会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to call for a press conference now.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.21,0:43:09.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 召开记者招待会  - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Call for a press conference? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.33,0:43:10.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为什么啊  - 霍根  开车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What on earth for? - Hogan, drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.60,0:43:12.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先去找汉堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cheeseburger first.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.59,0:43:26.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this!
