Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.78,0:43:34.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们本想去医院见你的  - 我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We were going to meet at the hospital. - No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.68,0:43:35.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.97,0:43:39.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你非得买个汉堡  - 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You had to have a burger, yeah? - Well, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.22,0:43:42.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 给我买了吗  - 只剩一个了  我很想吃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You get me one of those? - There's only one left. I need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.69,0:43:47.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看谁来了  好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, look who's here! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.91,0:43:54.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 波茨小姐  - 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Miss Potts? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.50,0:43:55.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能跟你说句话吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I speak to you for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.84,0:43:58.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不参加问答的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not part of the press conference,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.02,0:43:59.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但记者招待会马上就开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it's about to begin right now.
