Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.85,0:44:01.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是菲尔·科尔森特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Agent Phil Coulson,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.98,0:44:04.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我隶属国土战略防御攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the Strategic Homeland Intervention, Enforcement
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.26,0:44:06.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与后勤保障局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Logistics Division.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.05,0:44:08.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好拗口  - 是啊  我们还在改进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's quite a mouthful. - I know. We're working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.84,0:44:10.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国防部  联调局和中情局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, we've been approached already
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.31,0:44:13.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都已经找过我们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by the DOD, the FBI, the CIA...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.29,0:44:16.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是独立部门  目标更明确专一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're a separate division with a more specific focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.90,0:44:18.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要询问斯塔克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to debrief Mr Stark
