Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.86,0:44:23.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我会加到日程里的  好吗  - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll put something in the book, shall I? - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.87,0:44:31.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家可以坐下吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, would it be all right if everyone sat down?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.67,0:44:32.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都坐下吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you just sit down?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.58,0:44:34.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样你们都能看到我  我也能...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That way you can see me, and I can...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.24,0:44:36.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样不那么正式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little less formal and...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.05,0:44:44.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么变成嬉皮士聚会了  - 别问我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's up with the love-in? - Don't look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.95,0:44:46.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道他是想干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what he's up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.04,0:44:49.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 见到你真好  - 我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good to see you. - Good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.73,0:44:51.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没能跟爸爸说再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never got to say goodbye to Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.18,0:44:54.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没能跟我父亲说再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never got to say goodbye to my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.80,0:45:00.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有些问题想问他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's questions that I would have asked him.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.12,0:45:02.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想问他对公司的作为怎么看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would have asked him how he felt about what this company did.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.64,0:45:07.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是否有过挣扎  有过怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he was conflicted, if he ever had doubts.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.42,0:45:10.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许他就完全是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or maybe he was every inch
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.04,0:45:12.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新闻纪录片里的那个男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the man we all remember from the newsreels.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.13,0:45:19.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到了年轻的美国人被杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw young Americans killed
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.05,0:45:24.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀害他们的正是我为了维护他们而制造的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by the very weapons I created to defend them and protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.53,0:45:27.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I saw that I
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.13,0:45:29.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经成为了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had become part of a system
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.46,0:45:32.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愿负担责任的系统的一员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that is comfortable with zero accountability.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.03,0:45:35.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 斯塔克先生  - 本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr Stark! - Hey, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.68,0:45:37.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在那里经历了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.15,0:45:42.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我开了眼界  我意识到我可以为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had my eyes opened. I came to realise that I have more
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.39,0:45:46.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这世界做更多  而不只是制造爆炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to offer this world than just making things that blow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.82,0:45:50.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因此  即刻生效  我要关闭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that is why, effective immediately, I am shutting down
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.49,0:45:53.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯塔克国际公司的武器生产部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the weapons manufacturing division of Stark lnternational
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.04,0:45:55.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until such a time
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.74,0:45:58.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我决定好公司的未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as I can decide what the future of the company will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.38,0:46:00.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 大家这下不愁  - 决定好它的走向  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I think we're gonna be... -  What direction it should take,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.27,0:46:01.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 卖不出报纸了  - 我能接受的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- selling a lot of newspapers. - one that l'm comfortable with
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.81,0:46:04.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并且与国家最高利益\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and is consistent with the highest good
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.09,0:46:05.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一致的走向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for this country, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.96,0:46:10.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们应该记住的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What we should take away from this
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.04,0:46:12.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是托尼回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is that Tony's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.38,0:46:15.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且非常健康\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he's healthier than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.12,0:46:18.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们将进行内部探讨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to have a little internal discussion
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.18,0:46:20.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随后向大家通报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we'll get back to you with the follow-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.82,0:46:25.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他人呢  - 在里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where is he? - He's inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.89,0:46:38.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那...挺顺利嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that... That went well.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.00,0:46:41.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是在脑后放了个靶子吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I just paint a target on the back of my head?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.44,0:46:43.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的脑袋  那我的脑袋呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your head? What about my head?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.86,0:46:45.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得明天股价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think the over-under on the stock
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.42,0:46:47.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会跌到什么程度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}drop is gonna be tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.04,0:46:50.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 乐观估计  40点  - 至少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Optimistically, 40 points. - At minimum.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.58,0:46:51.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.75,0:46:55.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼  我们是武器制造商\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony, we're a weapons manufacturer.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.04,0:46:57.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奥比  我不希望我们将来只留下杀伤数字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obie, I just don't want a body count to be our only legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.72,0:46:58.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我们的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.84,0:47:00.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是铁商  我们制造武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're iron mongers. We make weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.68,0:47:01.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大楼上是我的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my name on the side of the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.63,0:47:04.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的工作让世界不会陷入混乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what we do keeps the world from falling into chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.51,0:47:05.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到的可不是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not based on what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.62,0:47:08.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们做得不够好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not doing a good enough job.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.64,0:47:09.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以做得更好  我们要做别的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can do better. We're gonna do something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.86,0:47:13.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么别的  你要我们做奶瓶吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like what? You want us to make baby bottles?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.09,0:47:17.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为我们该重新考虑方舟反应堆科技\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we should take another look into arc reactor technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.34,0:47:21.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得了  方舟反应堆就是个噱头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. The arc reactor, that's a publicity stunt!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.85,0:47:22.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼  拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.74,0:47:25.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们建这个是为了堵嬉皮士的嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We built that thing to shut the hippies up!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.17,0:47:28.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 成功了  - 是啊  作为科学项目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It works. - Yeah, as a science project.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.88,0:47:30.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,方舟反应堆的效益性根本不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The arc was never cost effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.31,0:47:32.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们建造之前就知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We knew that before we built it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.23,0:47:35.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,方舟反应堆科技是个死胡同  是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arc reactor technology, that's a dead end, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.45,0:47:36.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.96,0:47:39.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧  我们在这方面多久没有突破了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I right? We haven't had a breakthrough in that in what?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.89,0:47:41.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 30年吗  - 据说是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thirty years. - That's what they say.
