Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.37,1:08:00.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是斯塔克工业的一小部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is only one small part of what Stark Industries is all about,
