Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.43,1:08:09.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 托尼  记得我吗  - 完全不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Tony, remember me? - Sure don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.60,1:08:11.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,气色真不错  海夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look great, Hef.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.85,1:08:15.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一季我们会表现出色的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to have a great quarter.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.26,1:08:16.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这世界是怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the world coming to
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.11,1:08:18.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来自己的派对都没有请柬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when a guy's got to crash his own party?
