Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.41,1:08:24.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.78,1:08:28.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  悠着点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, take it slow, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.94,1:08:30.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得我已经安抚好董事会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I got the board right where we want them.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.87,1:08:33.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好嘞  我就是憋坏了  就玩一会儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it. Just cabin fever. I'll just be a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.05,1:08:40.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我杯威士忌  我饿死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a Scotch. I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.81,1:08:42.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯塔克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Stark?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.26,1:08:45.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么  - 科尔森特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah? - Agent Coulson.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.47,1:08:47.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  你是那个...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah. The guy from the...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.69,1:08:49.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国土战略防御\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strategic Homeland Intervention,
