Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.22,1:08:52.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天呐  你们需要新名字了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, you need a new name for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.91,1:08:54.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  我常听人这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I hear that a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.70,1:08:57.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  我知道您现在一定很不容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I know this must be a trying time for you,
