Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.54,1:09:01.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有很多问题未得到解答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's still a lot of unanswered questions,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.09,1:09:03.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种事情  时间有时很重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and time can be a factor with these things.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.64,1:09:05.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们约个时间吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just put something on the books.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.67,1:09:09.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,24日晚7点在斯塔克工业见如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about the 24th at 7:00 p.m. at Stark Industries?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.46,1:09:12.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样吧  说定了  你说得很对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell you what. You got it. You're absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.91,1:09:17.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去找我助理  定个日子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm going to go to my assistant, and we'll make a date.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.63,1:09:20.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太美了  我都没认出你来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look fantastic! I didn't recognise you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.79,1:09:22.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你怎么来了  - 回避政府特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing here? - Just avoiding government agents.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.98,1:09:24.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你一个人来的吗  - 嗯  裙子哪来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you by yourself? - Yes. Where'd you get that dress?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.97,1:09:26.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是生日礼物  - 太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, it was a birthday present. - That's great.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.58,1:09:29.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你送的  - 我的品位真棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- From you, actually. - Well, I got great taste.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.20,1:09:30.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.43,1:09:32.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 想跳舞吗  - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You want to dance? - Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.46,1:09:34.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 来嘛  - 谢谢了  不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right, come on. - Thank you. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.46,1:09:46.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我让你不舒服了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I making you uncomfortable?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.04,1:09:49.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.84,1:09:52.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我总忘记擦除臭剂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always forget to wear deodorant
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.03,1:09:55.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还当着我所有同事的面穿一件露背裙子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and dance with my boss in front of everyone that I work with
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.10,1:09:56.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我的老板跳舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a dress with no back.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.46,1:10:00.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你很美  也很香  - 天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You look great and you smell great. - Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.09,1:10:02.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果能让你舒服点  我可以解雇你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I could fire you if that would take the edge off.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.12,1:10:05.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得没了我你恐怕都不会系鞋带了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I actually don't think that you could tie your shoes without me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.80,1:10:07.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我能撑一周  - 是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'd make it a week. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.07,1:10:08.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 绝对的  - 你的社保号码是多少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sure. - What's your Social Security number?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.41,1:10:15.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 五  - 五\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Five. - Five?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.96,1:10:17.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好吧  - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Right. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.42,1:10:20.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你漏了几位数字  - 另外八个吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're missing just a couple of digits there. - The other eight?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.90,1:10:23.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另外八个有你嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I got you for the other eight.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.60,1:10:38.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 出去透口气吧  - 嗯  我需要透口气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How about a little air? - Yes, I need some air.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.59,1:10:42.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那感觉太怪了  - 完全没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That was totally weird. - Totally harmless.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.51,1:10:45.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was totally not harmless, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.64,1:10:46.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们跳了支舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're dancing.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.37,1:10:48.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 都没人看  - 我的所有同事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No one's even watching. - Everybody who I work with...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.08,1:10:48.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的  知道为什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you know why?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.96,1:10:49.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你不够客观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you lost objectivity.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.72,1:10:51.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得他们就是...人而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think they just... People...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.21,1:10:52.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就是跳了个舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just danced.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.12,1:10:53.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不只是跳舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it was not just a dance.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.32,1:10:55.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不懂  因为你是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't understand because you're you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.50,1:10:58.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人都清楚你是什么样的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And everybody knows exactly who you are
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.24,1:11:00.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么对待女人什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and how you are with girls and all of that,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.06,1:11:01.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这没什么关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which is completely fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.75,1:11:04.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我  你是我的老板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, you know, then me, you're my boss,
