Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.63,1:11:07.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我觉得没人会那么想的  - 这让我显得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't think it was taken that way. - Because it makes me look like
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.46,1:11:09.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the one who's trying to...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.01,1:11:11.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我觉得你想多了  - 我们又来到这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I just think you're overstating it. - You know, and we're here,
