Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.00,1:11:17.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裙子  我们还那样跳舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}dress, and then we were dancing like that and...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.74,1:11:34.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我想喝杯酒  谢谢  - 好嘞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I would like a drink, please. - Got it, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.05,1:11:39.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 伏特加马丁尼  谢谢  - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I would like a vodka martini, please. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.04,1:11:41.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不加水  要很多橄榄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very dry with olives, a lot of olives.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.87,1:11:44.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少三颗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like, at least three olives.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.73,1:11:45.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两杯伏特加马丁尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two vodka martinis,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.59,1:11:47.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不加水  多加橄榄  赶快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}extra dry, extra olives, extra fast.
