Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.90,1:11:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼·斯塔克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony Stark.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.46,1:11:59.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然在这里见到了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fancy seeing you here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.80,1:12:05.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 卡莉  - 克莉丝汀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Carrie. - Christine.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.08,1:12:06.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.09,1:12:08.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你今晚居然敢来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a lot of nerve showing up here tonight.
