Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.31,1:12:12.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慌张  我认为我的反应是慌张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Panic. I would say panic is my reaction.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.92,1:12:14.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是指你公司与最近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause I was referring to your company's
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.16,1:12:15.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一宗惨案的关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}involvement in this latest atrocity.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.68,1:12:17.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  他们向我发了邀请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. They just put my name on the invitation.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.13,1:12:18.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道能说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.34,1:12:20.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的差点相信了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I actually almost bought it, hook, line and sinker.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.78,1:12:22.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我出门了几个月  没听说吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was out of town for a couple months, in case you didn't hear.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.90,1:12:24.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是你所谓的负责任吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this what you call accountability?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.56,1:12:28.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里叫科米拉  听说过吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a town called Gulmira. Heard of it?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.07,1:12:36.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(斯塔克工业)
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.88,1:12:42.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是什么时候拍的  - 昨天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- When were these taken? - Yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.75,1:12:44.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我没有准许运输  - 你的公司准许了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I didn't approve any shipment. - Well, your company did.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.96,1:12:46.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是我的公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm not my company.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.97,1:12:50.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 请回避一下  - 你见过这些照片吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please, do you mind? - Have you seen these pictures?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.30,1:12:52.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 科米拉发生了什么  - 托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's going on in Gulmira? - Tony, Tony.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.79,1:12:54.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能这么天真\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't afford to be this naive.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.58,1:12:56.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我曾经很天真\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? I was naive before,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.23,1:12:57.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们说："这条线  我们不要越过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when they said, "Here's the line. We don't cross it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.95,1:12:59.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就这么做生意"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is how we do business."
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.59,1:13:02.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们暗地里做了两面派  我们有吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we're double-dealing under the table... Are we?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.16,1:13:04.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼  拍张照吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony, your picture, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.58,1:13:09.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们拍张照吧  来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's take a picture. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.03,1:13:11.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拍照片了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Picture time!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.94,1:13:16.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼  你以为是谁排挤了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony. Who do you think locked you out?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.73,1:13:19.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我提出了针对你的禁止令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was the one who filed the injunction against you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.39,1:13:24.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有这样我才能保护你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was the only way I could protect you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.74,1:13:28.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.85,1:13:39.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到达科米拉外围的15英里路程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The 15-mile hike to the outskirts of Gulmira
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.70,1:13:42.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只能被形容为堕入地狱之路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can only be described as a descent into hell,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.59,1:13:44.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进入当代的黑暗之心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into a modern day Heart of Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.95,1:13:48.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来自和平村庄的普通的农民和牧民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simple farmers and herders from peaceful villages
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.00,1:13:49.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被迫离开家园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have been driven from their homes,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.85,1:13:51.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被军阀赶出了他们的土地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}displaced from their lands by warlords
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.97,1:13:54.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新得的力量为这些人壮了胆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}emboldened by a new-found power.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.42,1:13:56.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,村民们被迫居住在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Villagers have been forced to take shelter
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.35,1:13:58.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他村庄的废墟中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in whatever crude dwellings they can find
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.62,1:14:00.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简陋的遮蔽处里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the ruins of other villages,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.43,1:14:04.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或是躲在这栋旧苏联冶炼厂遗址里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or here in the remnants of an old Soviet smelting plant.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.04,1:14:10.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近的暴力事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recent violence has been
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.24,1:14:12.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被归咎于一群外国士兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}attributed to a group of foreign fighters
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.47,1:14:15.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们被当地人称为十戒组织\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}referred to by locals as the Ten Rings.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.50,1:14:18.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以看到  他们军备齐全  而且目的明确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you can see, these men are heavily armed and on a mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.89,1:14:20.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何妨碍了他们的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A mission that could prove fatal
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.25,1:14:22.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都可能因此丧命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to anyone who stands in their way.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.23,1:14:25.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为没有政治干预或国际压力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With no political will or international pressure,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.79,1:14:28.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些难民希望渺茫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's very little hope for these refugees.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.49,1:14:31.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我身边的一个女人  在焦急等待丈夫的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Around me, a woman begging for news on her husband,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.76,1:14:33.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他被叛乱分子绑架了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who was kidnapped by insurgents,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.64,1:14:35.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知是被强迫加入他们的军队...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}either forced to join their militia...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.98,1:14:40.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,焦急的难民抓着泛黄的照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Desperate refugees clutch yellowed photographs,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.02,1:14:42.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给任何愿意驻足的人看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}holding them up to anyone who will stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.61,1:14:46.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子简单的问题:"我的妈妈爸爸在哪"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A child's simple question, "Where are my mother and father?"
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.80,1:14:50.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难民们希望渺茫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's very little hope for these refugees,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.23,1:14:54.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难民们只能想着  是否会有人来帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}refugees who can only wonder who, if anyone, will help.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.40,1:16:28.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.39,1:16:29.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把女人赶上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put the women in the trucks.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.90,1:16:31.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把武器存放在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stack the weapons here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.01,1:16:32.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把房子清空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear all the houses.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.03,1:16:34.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个  快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That one there. Faster. Faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.84,1:16:43.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住那家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab that dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.92,1:16:47.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他跟其他人放在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put him with the others.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.16,1:17:00.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.83,1:17:13.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打死这家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot this dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.86,1:17:15.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这群没用的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're all incompetent.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.85,1:17:20.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脑袋转过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn your head.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.36,1:18:27.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他交给你们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.09,1:19:28.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么玩意  我们准许去那里了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell was that? Were we cleared to go in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.10,1:19:27.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(加州  爱德华兹空军基地)
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.90,1:19:30.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有  长官  他们用了人肉盾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir, they were using human shields.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.12,1:19:31.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们没获得批准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We never got the green light.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.24,1:19:32.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我接国务院  肯定是他们搞的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put me through to State. They're going to be all over this.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.85,1:19:34.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,调出显示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get those monitors up!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.88,1:19:35.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发现不明物体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a bogey!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.19,1:19:38.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不是空军  - 接通中情局了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wasn't Air Force! - We got the CIA on the line?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.45,1:19:40.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我接通了兰利  他们还问是不是我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got Langley on the line. They want to know if it's us.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.58,1:19:42.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对不是我们  长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it definitely is not us, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.21,1:19:43.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不是海军  - 不是陆战队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It wasn't Navy. - Wasn't Marines.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.98,1:19:46.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要答案  能拿到目标图像吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need answers! Can I please get eyes on target?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.80,1:19:48.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不能  - 无法识别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Negative, negative. - Cannot identify.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.90,1:19:51.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上把武器研发的罗德中校叫来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me Colonel Rhodes from Weapons Development down here now!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.38,1:19:59.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们查了身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We ran an ID check
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.25,1:20:01.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并交叉对比了所有已知数据库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and cross-referenced with all known databases.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.27,1:20:02.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毫无发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.08,1:20:04.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当地有高空监控吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any high altitude surveillance in the region?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.23,1:20:06.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当地有空中早期预警和全球鹰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got an AWAC and a Global Hawk in the area.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.05,1:20:07.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这玩意是突然冒出来的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this thing just appeared out of nowhere?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.73,1:20:09.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会没在雷达上发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How come it didn't show up on the radar?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.30,1:20:11.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有很小的雷达截面  长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got a minimal radar cross-section, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.29,1:20:13.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 隐形的吗  - 不是  长官  它很小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is it stealth? - No, sir, it's tiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.64,1:20:15.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该是无人机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We think it's an unmanned aerial vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.00,1:20:17.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中校  这是什么情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel, what are we dealing with here?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.44,1:20:22.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我去打个电话  - 中士  清条线路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let me make a call. - Sergeant, clear a hole.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.01,1:20:28.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 喂  - 托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello? - Tony?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.83,1:20:30.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谁啊  - 罗德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's this? - It's Rhodes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.84,1:20:32.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 抱歉  谁  - 我说是罗德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sorry, hello? - I said it's Rhodes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.99,1:20:35.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 请大点声  - 那是什么噪音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Speak up, please. - What in the hell is that noise?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.90,1:20:37.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  我敞篷开车呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah, I'm driving with the top down.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.64,1:20:39.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在需要你帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, I need your help right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.46,1:20:40.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天道好轮回啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's funny how that works, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.82,1:20:41.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Speaking of funny,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.92,1:20:44.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个武器站刚被炸毁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we've got a weapons depot that was just blown up
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.27,1:20:46.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离你当初被囚的地方只有几公里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a few clicks from where you were being held captive.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.11,1:20:47.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里挺危险的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's a hot spot.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.88,1:20:50.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎是有人插手替你完成了工作  是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds like someone stepped in and did your job for you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.32,1:20:51.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么气喘吁吁的  托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you sound out of breath, Tony?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.58,1:20:52.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有  我在峡谷里慢跑呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not, I was justjogging in the canyon.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.83,1:20:54.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你不是在开车吗  - 是啊  我开车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I thought you were driving. - Right, I was driving
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.73,1:20:56.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到了峡谷  然后去慢跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the canyon, where I'm going to jog.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.53,1:20:57.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在那一带真没有什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure you don't have any tech
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.73,1:20:59.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我应该知道的东西吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in that area I should know about?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.12,1:21:00.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没有  - 发现不明物体了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nope! - Bogey spotted!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.74,1:21:02.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鞭子战机  正在前往\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whiplash, come in hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.07,1:21:03.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好  因为我眼前就有个东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, good, 'cause I'm staring at one right now,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.95,1:21:06.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上要被炸飞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it's about to be blown to kingdom come.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.24,1:21:08.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我该撤了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my exit.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.00,1:21:15.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战情室  这里是鞭子一号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ballroom, this is Whiplash One.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.33,1:21:17.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到不明物体了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got the bogey in my sights.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.60,1:21:19.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鞭子一号  那是什么玩意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whiplash One, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.23,1:21:20.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got no idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.61,1:21:23.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 能进行无线电联络吗  - 无反应  长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You have radio contact? - Non responsive, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.07,1:21:24.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你可以交火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you are clear to engage.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.93,1:21:27.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.19,1:21:27.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.02,1:21:34.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不明物体刚进入了超音速  我锁定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That bogey just went supersonic. I got a lock!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.00,1:21:41.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 导弹来袭  - 照明弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- lnbound missile. - Flares!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.03,1:21:46.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  不明物体调用了照明弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a second. Bogey deployed flares!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.99,1:22:02.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,展开襟翼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deploy flaps!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.48,1:22:04.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.72,1:22:06.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那玩意从雷达上消失了  长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That thing just jumped off the radar, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.29,1:22:07.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卫星盯丢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sat visual has been lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.04,1:22:09.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那绝不是无人机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No way that's a UAV.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.85,1:22:10.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.87,1:22:12.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么都看不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.58,1:22:14.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是什么  刚刚已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever it was, it just bought the farm.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.58,1:22:17.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不明物体应该已经被处理掉了  长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think bogey's been handled, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.56,1:22:29.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 喂  - 罗德  是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello? - Hi, Rhodey, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.34,1:22:31.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谁  - 抱歉  确实是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's who? - I'm sorry, it is me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.17,1:22:32.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你问了  你问的那个就是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You asked. What you were asking about is me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.51,1:22:34.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧  这不是游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, see, this isn't a game.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.10,1:22:37.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能把平民装备飞入我的活动战区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do not send civilian equipment into my active war zone.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.34,1:22:39.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你懂不懂  - 不是一件装备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You understand that? - This is not a piece of equipment.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.56,1:22:42.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在里面呢  是件战衣  那是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in it. It's a suit. It's me!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.35,1:22:43.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗德  你查到什么了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rhodey, you got anything for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.83,1:22:48.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 标记位置  回基地  - 收到  战情室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mark your position and return to base. - Roger that, Ballroom.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.54,1:22:52.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在你底下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On your belly!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.61,1:22:54.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像是个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt looks like a man!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.85,1:22:57.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甩掉他  翻滚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shake him off! Roll! Roll!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.52,1:23:06.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我被打中了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm hit! I'm hit!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.97,1:23:08.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确认  他被击中了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's confirmed. He has been hit.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.22,1:23:14.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跳伞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Punch out! Punch out!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.68,1:23:23.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鞭子一号坠机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whiplash One down.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.55,1:23:25.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鞭子二号  看到降落伞了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whiplash Two, do you see a chute?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.20,1:23:27.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有  没有降落伞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Negative! No chute, no chute!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.02,1:23:34.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的降落伞卡住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My chute's jammed!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.26,1:23:42.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官  我看到不明物体了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, I've got a visual on the bogey.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.73,1:23:43.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鞭子二号  再次出击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whiplash Two, reengage.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.93,1:23:45.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果能击落  就击落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you get a clear shot, you take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.92,1:23:49.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少校  我们都不知道那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Major, we don't even know what we're shooting at.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.68,1:23:50.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让猛禽回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call off the Raptors.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.35,1:23:51.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那玩意刚在合法禁飞区内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That thing just took out an F-22
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.73,1:23:53.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,击落了一架F22\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}inside a legal no fly zone!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.18,1:23:55.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鞭子二号  如果能击落  就击落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whiplash Two, if you have a clear shot, take it!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.87,1:23:58.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又被锁定了  进行躲避操作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been reengaged. Execute evasive manoeuvre.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.33,1:23:59.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.23,1:24:09.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,降落伞打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good chute! Good chute!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.92,1:24:19.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 托尼  你还在吗  - 谢谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tony, you still there? - Hey, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.76,1:24:22.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天呐  你个疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God, you crazy son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.19,1:24:25.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你欠我架飞机  你知道吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You owe me a plane. You know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.45,1:24:28.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,严格讲  是他撞了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, technically, he hit me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.24,1:24:30.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要过来看看我在做什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now are you going to come by and see what I'm working on?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.21,1:24:33.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  我知道得越少越好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, no, no, no, the less I know, the better.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.66,1:24:35.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要怎么跟媒体讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, what am I supposed to tell the press?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.32,1:24:37.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,演练  一般不都用这套屁话吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Training exercise. Isn't that the usual BS?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.91,1:24:39.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没那么简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not that simple.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.46,1:24:42.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天一架猛禽F22\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An unfortunate training exercise
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.37,1:24:45.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在演练中不幸发生事故\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}involving an F-22 Raptor occurred yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.96,1:24:49.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庆幸的是  飞行员并未受伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am pleased to report that the pilot was not injured.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.45,1:24:53.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至于科米拉村庄意料之外的局势反转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As for the unexpected turn of events on the ground in Gulmira,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.44,1:24:57.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁或是什么进行了干预  我们尚不清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it is still unclear who or what intervened,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.06,1:24:58.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我可以保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I can assure you that
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.33,1:25:01.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,此事与美国政府无关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the United States government was not involved.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.25,1:25:07.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,的确很贴身  先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a tight fit, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.13,1:25:11.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生  您越是扭动  就会越疼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, the more you struggle, the more this is going to hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.08,1:25:13.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,温柔点  这是我第一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be gentle. This is my first time.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.95,1:25:16.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我设计它能脱下来的  所以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I designed this to come off, so...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.08,1:25:20.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的应该能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really should be able to...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.36,1:25:22.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请尽量不要动  先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, try not to move, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.30,1:25:25.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.14,1:25:31.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,承认吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's face it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.79,1:25:33.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是你撞见我做的最糟糕的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not the worst thing you've caught me doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.79,1:25:37.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是弹孔吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are those bullet holes?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.17,1:26:06.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.72,1:26:11.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼·斯塔克的赠礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Compliments of Tony Stark.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.76,1:26:14.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你当初按计划杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you'd killed him when you were supposed to,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.36,1:26:15.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不会把脸烧掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'd still have a face.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.46,1:26:18.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你给我们点小钱杀一位王子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You paid us trinkets to kill a prince.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.71,1:26:20.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带我去看武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me the weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.67,1:26:25.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  让守卫留在外面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come. Leave your guards outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.97,1:26:44.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的逃脱带来了意外的收获\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His escape bore unexpected fruit.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.14,1:26:48.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是这么做到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this is how he did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.43,1:26:51.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这只是首次的粗糙的尝试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is only a first, crude effort.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.96,1:26:54.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯塔克已完善了他的设计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stark has perfected his design.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.81,1:26:57.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他制作了一件死亡杰作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has made a masterpiece of death.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.93,1:27:01.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有十几件这种战衣的人  能统治亚洲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A man with a dozen of these can rule all of Asia.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.81,1:27:04.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你梦想夺下斯塔克的王位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you dream of Stark's throne.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.92,1:27:08.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有共同的敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a common enemy.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.46,1:27:14.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们还在合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we are still in business,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.97,1:27:20.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会把设计给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will give you these designs
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.73,1:27:22.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当做礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as a gift.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.37,1:27:25.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为交换\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in turn,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.42,1:27:29.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你能礼尚往来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you'll repay me
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.35,1:27:32.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我钢铁战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with a gift of iron soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.55,1:27:46.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你唯一会得到的礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the only gift you shall receive.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.49,1:27:50.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科技\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Technology.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.74,1:27:55.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在世界的这一带一直是个致命弱点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's always been your Achilles' heel in this part of the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.50,1:28:00.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心  只会持续15分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry. It'll only last for 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.81,1:28:03.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你最不需要担心的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the least of your problems.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.45,1:28:11.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把装甲和其余的装箱带走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crate up the armour and the rest of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.74,1:28:15.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  我们做个了结吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let's finish up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.75,1:28:22.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让方舟反应堆下的16区做好准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Set up Sector 16 underneath the arc reactor,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.71,1:28:24.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要遮蔽这些数据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'm going to want this data masked.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.78,1:28:26.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找来我们最好的工程师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recruit our top engineers.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.47,1:28:28.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上给我造个原型机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want a prototype right away.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.57,1:28:39.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你忙吗  可以替我去办件事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You busy? You mind if I send you on an errand?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.68,1:28:41.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要你去我办公室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to go to my office.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.38,1:28:43.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑入主机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to hack into the mainframe
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.59,1:28:45.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿到所有最近的运输清单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you're going to retrieve all the recent shipping manifests.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.47,1:28:46.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是锁定芯片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a lock chip.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.64,1:28:48.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能让你黑进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This'll get you in.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.33,1:28:50.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概是在执行文档里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's probably under Executive Files.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.97,1:28:52.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不  就是在幽灵驱动上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If not, they put it on a ghost drive,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.80,1:28:55.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样的话  你就得查找标题数码最小的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in which case you need to look for the lowest numeric heading.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.41,1:28:58.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我拿回了信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what do you plan to do with this information
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.17,1:28:59.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打算怎么做呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I bring it back here?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.05,1:29:00.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是那套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same drill.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.10,1:29:02.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在暗箱操作  我要阻止他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've been dealing under the table, and I'm going to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.14,1:29:05.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要找到我的武器  摧毁它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to find my weapons and destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.18,1:29:07.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.61,1:29:11.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我愿帮你做任何事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you know that I would help you with anything,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.60,1:29:15.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果你又要这么胡来  我就不能帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I cannot help you if you're going to start all of this again.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.63,1:29:19.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了这个  别无其他  没有艺术馆开幕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is nothing except this. There's no art opening.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.55,1:29:22.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或是慈善晚会  或是签什么字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no benefit. There is nothing to sign.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.84,1:29:27.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有下一项任务  没有别的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is the next mission and nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.20,1:29:29.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.78,1:29:33.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我辞职\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then, I quit.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.23,1:29:37.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么多年来  你一直在我身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stood by my side all these years
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.98,1:29:40.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看着我收获毁灭的利益\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while I reaped the benefits of destruction.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.10,1:29:43.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我想保护那些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now that I'm trying to protect the people
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.03,1:29:44.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因我而身陷危险的人  你却要走人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I put in harm's way, you're going to walk out?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.92,1:29:46.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会害死自己的  托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to kill yourself, Tony.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.58,1:29:49.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要助你一臂之力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going to be a part of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.50,1:29:50.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本不该活下来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shouldn't be alive,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.72,1:29:54.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非这有什么意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}unless it was for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.82,1:29:57.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没疯  派珀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not crazy, Pepper.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.09,1:30:01.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是终于知道  我该做什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just finally know what I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.63,1:30:08.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我心里知道  这是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I know in my heart that it's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.25,1:30:25.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也是我的一切了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're all I have, too, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.86,1:31:13.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(警告  安全漏洞)
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.28,1:31:19.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(访问)
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.16,1:31:24.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(找到“幽灵”驱动)
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.09,1:31:36.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(16区  读取文档)
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.24,1:31:37.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,16区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sector 16?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.31,1:31:41.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么  奥巴代亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you up to, Obadiah?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.90,1:31:53.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(翻译)
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.83,1:31:56.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可没说你付钱叫我们杀的目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did not tell us that the target you paid us to kill
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.68,1:31:58.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是了不起的托尼·斯塔克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was the great Tony Stark.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.26,1:31:59.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你可以看到  - 天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- As you can see, - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.08,1:31:59.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奥巴代亚·斯坦尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obadiah Stane...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.89,1:32:02.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的欺骗和谎言会让你付出高额代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...your deception and lies will cost you dearly.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.77,1:32:05.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀托尼·斯塔克的价钱刚刚涨了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The price to kill Tony Stark has just gone up.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.75,1:32:06.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(开始复制)
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.51,1:32:14.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么  我们要怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what are we going to do about this?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.87,1:32:29.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我理解你现在的处境  派珀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what you're going through, Pepper.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.24,1:32:40.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼  他的东西总是好的  是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony. He always gets the good stuff, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.12,1:33:06.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他回家时我好开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was so happy when he came home.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.69,1:33:09.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就好像他死而复生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was like we got him back from the dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.50,1:33:14.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我意识到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I realise,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.70,1:33:20.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼其实根本没有回家来  是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}well, Tony never really did come home, did he?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.70,1:33:24.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他把自己的一部分留在了那个洞里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He left a part of himself in that cave.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.20,1:33:28.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伤透了我的心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breaks my heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.13,1:33:35.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是个复杂的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he's a complicated person.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.76,1:33:41.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他经受了很多事  我觉得他会没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been through a lot. I think he'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.56,1:33:50.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是个少见的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a very rare woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.76,1:33:55.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼不知道自己多么幸运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony doesn't know how lucky he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.65,1:33:59.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你  谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.74,1:34:03.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得回去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd better get back there.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.20,1:34:10.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是今天的报纸吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that today's paper?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.86,1:34:13.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.69,1:34:15.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能给我看看吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.74,1:34:18.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没问题  - 填字谜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not at all. - Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.88,1:34:19.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.42,1:34:24.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take care.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.94,1:34:41.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(下载完成)
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.74,1:34:51.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波茨小姐  我们预约好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ms Potts? We had an appointment.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.09,1:34:51.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你忘记了我们的约会吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you forget about our appointment?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.88,1:34:53.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有  就现在  跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope, right now. Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.47,1:34:54.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 现在  - 我们现在就谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Right now? - We're going to have it right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.42,1:34:56.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对  跟我走  - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, walk with me. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.57,1:34:59.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要跟你好好谈谈  包你一辈子不忘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to give you the meeting of your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.33,1:35:00.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去你办公室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your office.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.44,1:35:03.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一直在尽力而为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we've been working our best to do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.54,1:35:07.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然  我们...我回头打给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely, we're... I'm going to have to call you back.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.34,1:35:09.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯坦尼先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Stane?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.35,1:35:11.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生  我们尝试了您的要求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, we've explored what you've asked us,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.65,1:35:13.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但似乎遇到了点小小障碍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it seems as though there's a little hiccup.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.33,1:35:15.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 其实  - 障碍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Actually... - A hiccup?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.12,1:35:16.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  为给战衣供能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, to power the suit,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.16,1:35:19.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生  那种科技尚不存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sir, the technology actually doesn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.14,1:35:21.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 所以  - 等等  科技\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So it's... - Wait, wait, wait. The technology?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.46,1:35:25.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,威廉  这就是那个科技\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}William, here is the technology.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.44,1:35:28.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是叫你把它造小点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've asked you to simply make it smaller.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.60,1:35:30.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  先生  我们也在努力尝试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, sir, and that's what we're trying to do,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.10,1:35:32.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但老实说  这不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but honestly, it's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.61,1:35:36.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼·斯塔克在一个山洞里就造成了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony Stark was able to build this in a cave!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.41,1:35:39.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用的是一堆破烂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With a box of scraps!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.33,1:35:44.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  我不是托尼·斯塔克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm sorry. I'm not Tony Stark.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.16,1:35:58.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(派珀·波茨来电)
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.64,1:36:01.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.32,1:36:08.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼  你在吗  喂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony, are you there? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.35,1:36:10.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breathe.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.63,1:36:14.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy, easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.48,1:36:18.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你记得这个吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You remember this one, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.42,1:36:22.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真可惜政府没批准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a shame the government didn't approve it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.51,1:36:26.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诱发短暂麻痹用途多广泛啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's so many applications for causing short-term paralysis.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.36,1:36:30.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.86,1:36:37.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我找人杀你时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I ordered the hit on you,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.87,1:36:42.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I worried that I was
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.43,1:36:47.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是杀了金鹅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}killing the golden goose.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.79,1:36:50.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, you see,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.31,1:36:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那真是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it was just
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.83,1:36:56.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,命运  你偏偏活了下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}fate that you survived that.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.21,1:37:05.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还要给出最后一枚金蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had one last golden egg to give.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.33,1:37:10.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真以为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you really think
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.69,1:37:14.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想了个点子  它就是你的了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that just because you have an idea, it belongs to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.42,1:37:19.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.81,1:37:23.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他帮忙造了原子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he helped give us the atomic bomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.66,1:37:25.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他像你这么自私\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, what kind of world would it be today
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.62,1:37:27.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在的世界会是什么样啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if he was as selfish as you?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.92,1:37:39.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是美丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.63,1:37:47.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.63,1:37:47.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼  这是你的第九交响乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony, this is your Ninth Symphony.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.30,1:37:51.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是杰作  看啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a masterpiece. Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.11,1:37:54.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你的遗产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is your legacy.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.46,1:37:59.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新一代的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A new generation of weapons
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.85,1:38:02.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将有它作为心脏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with this at its heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.84,1:38:09.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些武器会把世界拉回正轨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weapons that will help steer the world back on course,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.68,1:38:12.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让权力落在我们手中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}put the balance of power in our hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.60,1:38:14.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,合适的手中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The right hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.29,1:38:23.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真希望你能看到我的原型机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish you could see my prototype.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.19,1:38:25.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然不像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not as...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.21,1:38:30.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不像你的那个那么保守\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, not as conservative as yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.05,1:38:34.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惜你还把派珀卷了进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too bad you had to involve Pepper in this.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.36,1:38:37.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本来更想留她一命的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would have preferred that she lived.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.95,1:38:53.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思  他花钱雇人去杀托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, he paid to have Tony killed?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.29,1:38:55.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,派珀  慢点说  奥巴代亚为什么要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pepper, slow down. Why would Obadiah...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.23,1:38:58.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  托尼现在在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, where's Tony now?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.53,1:39:00.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道  他不接电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. He's not answering his phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.54,1:39:02.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你过去一趟  确保他没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please go over there and make sure everything's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.94,1:39:05.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢  罗德  我知道条近路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Rhodey. I know a shortcut.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.58,1:40:12.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.66,1:40:53.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.39,1:40:57.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.16,1:41:00.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.54,1:41:03.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.28,1:41:07.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.56,1:41:11.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼  你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony! You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.36,1:41:13.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,派珀呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Pepper?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.07,1:41:15.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她没事  她身边有五个特工呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's fine. She's with five agents.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.97,1:41:17.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们要去逮捕奥巴代亚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're about to arrest Obadiah.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.42,1:41:19.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not going to be enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.36,1:41:45.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,16区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Section 16.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.11,1:41:48.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,16区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Section 16.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.49,1:41:50.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那儿呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.35,1:42:01.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的钥匙没用  打不开门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My key's not working. It's not opening the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.77,1:42:04.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么  小装置吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that? It's, like, a little device?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.20,1:42:05.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能开锁吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's, like, a thing that's going to pick the lock?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.98,1:42:07.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最好退后几步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might want to take a few steps back.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.32,1:42:29.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那真是我见过的最酷的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the coolest thing I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.79,1:42:30.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不赖吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not bad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.97,1:42:32.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.46,1:42:41.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还需要我做什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need me to do anything else?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.25,1:42:43.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让人上天搅局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep the skies clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.20,1:42:50.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.49,1:42:59.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次吧  宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next time, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.28,1:43:33.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来你是对的  他是在造战衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like you were right. He was building a suit.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.24,1:43:35.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为会更大些呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it'd be bigger.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.25,1:44:22.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him out!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.97,1:44:35.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得马克1号的胸膛电源能不能撑得住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you think the Mark I chest piece is going to hold up?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.21,1:44:37.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战衣电力为48%  还在减少  先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The suit's at 48% power and falling, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.47,1:44:40.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这块胸膛电源不是设计用来飞行的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That chest piece was never designed for sustained flight.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.47,1:44:41.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随时通知我情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep me posted.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.65,1:44:44.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,派珀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pepper!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.53,1:44:46.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼  你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony! Tony, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.40,1:44:47.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事  你怎么...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine. How are...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.56,1:44:49.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 奥巴代亚  他疯了  - 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Obadiah, he's gone insane! - I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.68,1:44:51.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你最好赶紧走  - 他建了套战衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Listen, you'd better get out of there. - He built a suit.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.50,1:44:52.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点  马上走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of there right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.90,1:45:06.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想去哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.69,1:45:15.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不再需要你的服务了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your services are no longer required.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.06,1:45:17.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯坦尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stane!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.68,1:45:44.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱这套战衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love this suit!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.42,1:45:47.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 把他们放下  - 附带伤害  托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Put them down! - Collateral damage, Tony.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.15,1:45:50.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向胸膛转移能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Divert power to chest RT.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.17,1:46:02.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能量仅剩19%\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Power reduced to 19%.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.93,1:46:10.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lady!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.94,1:46:14.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.14,1:46:40.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,30年了  我一直捧着你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For 30 years, I've been holding you up!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.50,1:46:46.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从零建立起了这家公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I built this company from nothing!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.09,1:46:51.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都别想妨碍我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing is going to stand in my way.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.96,1:47:00.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你更别想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Least of all you!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.89,1:47:13.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厉害  你升级了你的盔甲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impressive! You've upgraded your armour!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.64,1:47:16.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我自己也有升级\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've made some upgrades of my own!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.81,1:47:26.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生  他的战衣似乎能飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, it appears that his suit can fly.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.85,1:47:28.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发现了  带我飞到最高高度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Duly noted. Take me to maximum altitude.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.72,1:47:30.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在只有15%的电力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With only 15% power,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.12,1:47:31.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达到这高度的可能性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the odds of reaching that...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.05,1:47:33.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会算算数  照做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know the math! Do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.51,1:47:43.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官  你不会相信的  那玩意回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, you're not going to believe this. That thing is back.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.85,1:47:46.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接艾伦少校  集结飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me Major Allen. Scramble the jets!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.16,1:47:52.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不必了  各位  只是演练\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not necessary, people. Just a training exercise.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.56,1:47:53.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.37,1:48:02.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只剩13%的电力了  先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thirteen percent power, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.85,1:48:03.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续爬升\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Climb!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.47,1:48:09.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 11%  - 继续飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Eleven percent. - Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.22,1:48:18.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 电力为7%  - 在屏幕上显示就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Seven percent power. - Just leave it on the screen!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.35,1:48:19.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop telling me!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.71,1:48:31.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的点子很棒  托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had a great idea, Tony,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.30,1:48:34.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我的战衣在各方面都更先进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but my suit is more advanced in every way!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:34.80,1:48:36.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么解决结冰问题的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you solve the icing problem?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.95,1:48:38.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么结冰问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Icing problem?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.69,1:48:42.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最好查看一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Might want to look into it.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.64,1:48:55.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,2%\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two percent.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.10,1:49:00.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在在使用紧急备用电力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are now running on emergency backup power.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.63,1:49:16.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 波茨  - 托尼  天呐  你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Potts! - Tony! Oh, my God, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.22,1:49:17.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我快没电了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm almost out of power.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.56,1:49:19.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得脱掉战衣  我就过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got to get out of this thing. I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.39,1:49:21.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想得美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice try!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.71,1:49:36.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,武器状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weapons status?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.46,1:49:39.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冲击系统下线  导弹下线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Repulsors offline. Missiles offline.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.91,1:49:43.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,燃烧弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flares!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.87,1:49:55.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真聪明  托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very clever, Tony.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.29,1:50:02.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 波茨  - 托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Potts? - Tony!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.83,1:50:03.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't working.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.41,1:50:06.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得过载反应堆  炸碎屋顶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to have to overload the reactor and blast the roof.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.29,1:50:09.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你要怎么做到  - 你来做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, how are you going to do that? - You're going to do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.20,1:50:11.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去中央控制台  打开所有电路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to the central console, open up all the circuits.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.72,1:50:13.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我撤离了屋顶  就告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I get clear of the roof, I'll let you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.02,1:50:15.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就按下主旁路按钮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to hit the master bypass button.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.01,1:50:17.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上面的一切都会被烧毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's going to fry everything up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.50,1:50:21.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  我这就进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. I'm going in now.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.85,1:50:24.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定等我离开屋顶的  我给你争取点时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make sure you wait till I clear the roof. I'll buy you some time.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.65,1:50:36.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个看上去挺重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This looks important!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.40,1:50:59.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一向不怎么喜欢这种玩意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never had a taste for this sort of thing,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:00.30,1:51:04.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我得承认  我非常喜欢这件战衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I must admit, I'm deeply enjoying the suit!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.64,1:51:15.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可算超常发挥了  托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You finally outdid yourself, Tony!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.62,1:51:19.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会让你父亲自豪的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd have made your father proud!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.65,1:51:26.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好了  托尼  快离开屋顶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's ready, Tony! Get off the roof!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.64,1:51:48.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.14,1:51:50.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是讽刺  托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How ironic, Tony!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.73,1:51:54.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想让世界上不再有武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trying to rid the world of weapons,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.43,1:51:57.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却发明了最棒的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you gave it its best one ever!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.65,1:51:59.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 派珀  - 现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pepper! - And now
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.68,1:52:03.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要拿它杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to kill you with it!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.73,1:52:10.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你扯掉了我的瞄准系统  - 按按钮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You ripped out my targeting system! - Time to hit the button!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.72,1:52:14.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你叫我别按的  - 别动  你个小混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You told me not to! - Hold still, you little prick!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.59,1:52:19.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 动手吧  - 你会死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just do it! - You'll die!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.39,1:52:23.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Push it!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.25,1:53:22.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.41,1:53:33.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位都拿到了昨晚斯塔克工业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've all received the official statement of
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.49,1:53:43.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.36,1:53:35.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事件经过的官方报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what occurred at Stark lndustries last night.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.34,1:53:38.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有未经证实的报告称\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There have been unconfirmed reports
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.14,1:53:40.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一件机器人原型机发生故障\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that a robotic prototype malfunctioned
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.96,1:53:43.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,导致方舟反应堆受损\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and caused damage to the arc reactor.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.34,1:53:46.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好  托尼·斯塔克的一位私人保镖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fortunately, a member of Tony Stark's personal security staff...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.42,1:53:47.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.68,1:53:48.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"钢铁侠"  挺上口  挺响亮的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Iron Man." That's kind of catchy. It's got a nice ring to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.63,1:53:49.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然并不准确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, it's not technically accurate.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.98,1:53:52.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战衣是金钛合金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The suit's a gold-titanium alloy,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:52.38,1:53:55.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这种意向呼之欲出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it's kind of evocative, the imagery, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.16,1:53:56.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你的不在场证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's your alibi.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:57.70,1:53:58.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.83,1:54:01.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你在你的游艇上  - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You were on your yacht. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.06,1:54:03.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有港口报告证明你整晚都在阿瓦隆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have port papers that put you in Avalon all night,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:03.25,1:54:05.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有你50位宾客的宣誓证词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and sworn statements from 50 of your guests.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:05.19,1:54:08.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许该说只有我和派珀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, I was thinking maybe we should say it was just Pepper and me
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.25,1:54:10.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,单独在岛上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}alone on the island.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:11.39,1:54:12.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 就是这样的  - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's what happened. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.74,1:54:14.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照读就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just read it, word for word.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.79,1:54:18.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上面没提斯坦尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing about Stane here.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.86,1:54:21.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这已经处理好了  他去度假了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's being handled. He's on vacation.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.45,1:54:24.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小型飞机的安全记录很差\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Small aircraft have such a poor safety record.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.00,1:54:27.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但关于保镖的那套掩护说辞呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what about the whole cover story that it's a bodyguard?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:27.68,1:54:28.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我的...这...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's my... I mean, is that...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.93,1:54:30.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这太站不住脚了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's kind of flimsy, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.63,1:54:32.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是第一次做这种事了  斯塔克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't my first rodeo, Mr Stark.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.01,1:54:34.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按官方说辞念就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just stick to the official statement,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.17,1:54:36.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快  这一切都会过去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and soon, this will all be behind you.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.12,1:54:39.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有90秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got 90 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.25,1:54:43.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科尔森特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agent Coulson?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:44.59,1:54:48.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想说  非常感谢你的一切帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wanted to say thank you very much for all of your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.16,1:54:52.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我们的职责  我们还会再联系的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what we do. You'll be hearing from us.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.36,1:54:55.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你们叫国土战略  - 喊我们神盾局就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- From the Strategic Homeland... - Just call us S.H.I.E.L.D.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.17,1:54:57.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.27,1:54:59.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get this show on the road.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:59.89,1:55:02.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实也没那么糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, it's actually not that bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.11,1:55:03.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就连我都不觉得自己像钢铁侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even I don't think I'm Iron Man.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.60,1:55:06.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你不是钢铁侠  - 我是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're not Iron Man. - Am so.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:06.24,1:55:08.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你不是  - 好吧  随你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're not. - All right, suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:08.78,1:55:10.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我是钢铁侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, if I were Iron Man,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.26,1:55:12.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会有个知道我真实身份的女友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd have this girlfriend who knew my true identity.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.70,1:55:13.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且她会很崩溃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'd be a wreck,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:13.54,1:55:15.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为她会非常担心我会不会送命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'cause she'd always be worrying that I was going to die,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.28,1:55:17.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但又为我的成就感到骄傲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}yet so proud of the man I'd become.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.87,1:55:22.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她会非常矛盾  而这又让她更加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'd be wildly conflicted, which would only make her more
Dialogue: 0,1:55:23.52,1:55:24.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为我疯狂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}crazy about me.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.45,1:55:26.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你难道就没想过那晚的事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me you never think about that night.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.25,1:55:27.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哪一晚  - 你知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What night? - You know.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:31.07,1:55:32.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you talking about
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.10,1:55:34.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一起跳舞的那晚吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the night that we danced
Dialogue: 0,1:55:34.27,1:55:36.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我们上了屋顶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and went up on the roof,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.43,1:55:39.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.87,1:55:44.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去楼下拿酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you went downstairs to get me a drink,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.12,1:55:47.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后就撇下了我一人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you left me there, by myself?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.64,1:55:50.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说那晚吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that the night you're talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:53.39,1:55:54.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thought so.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.11,1:55:58.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有别的事了吧  斯塔克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will that be all, Mr Stark?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:58.01,1:56:00.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  没别的事了  波茨小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, that will be all, Miss Potts.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.97,1:56:04.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在  斯塔克先生准备了一份声明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, Mr Stark has prepared a statement.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:04.58,1:56:07.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不会接受提问的  谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will not be taking any questions. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:11.82,1:56:14.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自我上次见大家过去好一阵了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Been a while since I was in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:14.02,1:56:15.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这次还是照稿读吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I figure I'll stick to the cards this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:18.89,1:56:19.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人猜测\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's been speculation
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.83,1:56:21.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我卷入了之前发生在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I was involved in the events that occurred
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.91,1:56:23.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高速和屋顶上的事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the freeway and the rooftop...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:23.18,1:56:24.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  斯塔克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Mr Stark,
Dialogue: 0,1:56:24.29,1:56:26.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的指望我们相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but do you honestly expect us to believe that
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.15,1:56:30.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是一个穿战衣的保镖  碰巧出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that was a bodyguard in a suit that conveniently appeared,
Dialogue: 0,1:56:30.04,1:56:32.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 尽管你...  - 我知道情况让人糊涂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- despite the fact that you... - I know that it's confusing.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.26,1:56:35.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,质疑官方说辞是一回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is one thing to question the official story,
Dialogue: 0,1:56:35.90,1:56:38.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但提出疯狂指控  或暗示说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and another thing entirely to make wild accusations,
Dialogue: 0,1:56:38.24,1:56:40.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是个超级英雄可是另一码事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or insinuate that I'm a superhero.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.40,1:56:42.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可没说你是超级英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never said you were a superhero.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.08,1:56:43.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗  那很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't? Well, good,
Dialogue: 0,1:56:43.64,1:56:47.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为那是不着边际  异想天开的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because that would be outlandish and fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.39,1:56:53.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我显然不是做英雄的料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just not the hero type. Clearly.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:53.21,1:56:56.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有一堆性格缺陷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With this laundry list of character defects,
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.31,1:56:57.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,犯过那么多错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all the mistakes I've made,
Dialogue: 0,1:56:57.76,1:57:01.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 还很公开  - 照稿读就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- largely public. - Just stick to the cards, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.24,1:57:03.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, okay. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:05.01,1:57:06.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The truth is
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.70,1:57:14.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是钢铁侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Iron Man.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:17.38,2:05:18.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贾维斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jarvis!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:18.78,2:05:20.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎回家  先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome home, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:23.90,2:05:25.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"我就是钢铁侠"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I am Iron Man."
Dialogue: 0,2:05:26.83,2:05:29.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为你是这世上唯一的超级英雄吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you're the only superhero in the world?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:29.79,2:05:30.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯塔克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Stark,
Dialogue: 0,2:05:30.50,2:05:32.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经成为了更大的宇宙的一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you've become part of a bigger universe.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.96,2:05:35.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只是现在还不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just don't know it yet.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:35.36,2:05:36.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:37.44,2:05:40.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼克·弗瑞  神盾局局长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick Fury, Director of S.H.I.E.L.D.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:42.17,2:05:44.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来跟你谈谈复仇者联盟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here to talk to you about the Avenger Initiative.

